#: ../../source/docs/common-durandal-overview.rst:9
#: 18771dc068214196873656efaac05c4c 49056943e2734e7ea06b6ab9f98a805a
#: 8b62aa372e0644019465fc57e17b71b0 d633cf0e9a7c4048875e54190ceeb627
#: e86fb507af554139b55f1b310334e701 ed1c930f46cb45debcefd2d4c82bd312
msgid ""
"Durandal is the latest update to the successful family of Holybro "
"autopilots. It was designed and developed by Holybro, optimized to run the "
"latest ArduPilot firmware. It features the STM32H743 microprocessor, the "
"latest advanced processor technology from STMicroelectronics®, plus sensor "
"technology from Bosch® and InvenSense®, and a ChibiOS real-time operating "
"system, delivering incredible performance, flexibility, and reliability for "
"controlling any autonomous vehicle. Durandal’s microcontroller now has 2 MB "
"of Flash memory and 1 MB of RAM."
msgstr ""
"Durandal 是 Holybro 成功飞控产品系列的最新升级版。它由 Holybro 设计开发，针对运行最新 ArduPilot "
"固件进行了优化。它搭载 STM32H743 微处理器——STMicroelectronics® 最新的先进处理器技术，以及来自 Bosch® 和 "
"InvenSense® 的传感器技术，并运行 ChibiOS 实时操作系统，为控制任何自主飞行器提供出色的性能、灵活性和可靠性。Durandal "
"的微控制器现拥有 2MB Flash 存储器和 1MB RAM。"

